    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Superb three-bedroom mid terrace home with a paved driveway and is brimming with refurbishment potential.\r\n\r\nThis fantastic property features a paved driveway leading to an attractive brick façade with a storm porch. The property has an inviting entrance hall enjoying laminate flooring and understairs storage. To the right of the entrance hall is the kitchen. The downstairs is completed by a spacious and light-filled living room and dining area, which features carpet flooring, a feature fireplace and provides access to a generous back garden. Upstairs features three bedrooms, two of which enjoy built-in wardrobes. The property is completed by a tiled family bathroom and a hot press. The attic can also be access via the bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe property is ideally situated in the popular Yellow Meadows estate in Clondalkin. The estate is well established and is within easy reach of Clondalkin Village, which offers a great selection of shops, cafés, restaurants and other local amenities. The area is also well served by public transport, with regular bus routes providing easy access to Dublin City Centre. The M50, N7 and Red Cow Luas are also all within easy reach. There are also several primary and secondary schools nearby."
      },
